# These are consumed on Linux workers and in containers. CRLF breaks shebangs
# and Dockerfile line continuations, which is exactly how OpenPiton's tooling
# broke when it was first checked out on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
